ulation of this application does not guarantee the design, size, range of motion, etc. of the actual robot.\nWhen actually installing a robot, please check the specifications on the product page.\n- Please be careful of your surroundings when using this app.", "short_description": "You can place OVR series virtual robots in real space and simulate operation.\nThe OVR series is a robot sold by Oriental Motor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1594860848028062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1594860854694728_1273340538204967659_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LOZ7XiGF-4QQ7kNvwFNabBc&_nc_oc=AdrZ_F-gCiS59-fTIrEdnpe5IQbCQcxH6MparTqZYCMlT9XT1jTbLehjizyd82ylQqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTVFyCNEL0cnesv8encIxGYMtxNoM2-nQnN2yK9hjSQ2Q&oe=6B033716"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscapeMini.png", "id": "858590429630683", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_858590432964016_3799015126354441121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BN4hSPrzUl0Q7kNvwEM_Pdh&_nc_oc=Ado2h3gtLS0Rswcg5-22sQzsqHd6laNxwc2aQlndOaov_MLA6VgDNbz70zdDcsFfj8I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQBswqs6-bbxpBK-w-y5sNbe7bJmJCqQ9prT6gLVqGZIg&oe=6B03025C"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "495376463065176", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_495376466398509_7417159219708782199_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hUamdcjZoM4Q7kNvwHXKnDF&_nc_oc=AdqVmvm8bGLwU1O_uHzqZrUNM-n8iD6BFel4T9PqQZmd9cJn1tHkHnkpqJCPfZWvLg8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTt3U3erACbqGLRYWtp16j-1fRCrpaORx0GJ56z9ODFSQ&oe=6B031BDB"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "486